.Dd March 2, 2026
.Dt ELF_OPEN_MEMORY_WITH_OPTIONS 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm elf_open_memory_with_options
.Nd open an ELF object from memory with explicit open flags
.Sh LIBRARY
libelfobj
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In elfobj.h
.Ft elf_err_t
.Fn elf_open_memory_with_options "const void *buf" "size_t size" "uint32_t flags" "elfobj_t **out"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn elf_open_memory_with_options
parses an ELF object from memory while applying
.Fa flags
such as
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_NOCOPY
and
.Dv ELFOBJ_OPEN_LAZY_PARSE .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns
.Dv ELF_OK
on success, otherwise an
.Vt elf_err_t
code.
.Sh ERRORS
Possible errors include
.Dv ELF_ERR_STATE ,
.Dv ELF_ERR_OOM ,
and ELF parse/format errors.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr elf_open_memory 3 ,
.Xr elf_open_memory_nocopy 3
